#: aae54f8b19254ff482635a0af6d6c6b6 b9c1ca37c2aa46029d0b2c827be6bde7
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all "
"unidirectional RC protocols except PPM. FPort and full duplex protocols, "
"like CRSF/ELRS, will need to use TX2 also."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认通过 USART2 的 RX 引脚配置。支持除 PPM 外的所有单向 RC 协议。FPort 与 CRSF/ELRS "
"等全双工协议还需同时使用 TX2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:56
#: 27b0bda235a34bba9103657e19dc2936 3134ae68aecc4fa89594928488922128
#: 375a7cd6787d4df19ee2ed713de5c4ae 4485d187bd414b868b003fe820676568
#: 93828890f7c94e9bb102563b7e4ca24e a87cb4aa5ee94fe0ba89ec87e615a8b4
msgid ""
"If the receiver is FPort or a full duplex protocol, then the receiver must "
"be tied to the USART2 TX pin and `SERIAL2_OPTIONS "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#serial2-options>`_ = 7 "
"(invert TX/RX, half duplex), and `RSSI_TYPE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#rssi-type>`_ =3."
msgstr ""
"如果接收机使用 FPort 或全双工协议，则接收机必须连接到 USART2 的 TX 引脚，并设置 `SERIAL2_OPTIONS "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#serial2-options>`_ = 7（反转"
" TX/RX，半双工），以及 `RSSI_TYPE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#rssi-type>`_ = 3。"

