msgid ""
"The TAKER F745 BT supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1"
" to M4 are on the esc connector, M5-M8 are solder pads, plus M9 is defaulted"
" for serial LED strip or can be used as another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"TAKER F745 BT 支持最多 9 路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘在 ESC 连接器上，M5-M8 是焊盘，M9 默认用于串行"
" LED 灯带或可用作另一路 PWM 输出。"

